    "result_text": "The change is complete and the test suite is green.\n\n## Summary\n\nThe `GET /api/owners/{id}` response is an `OwnerDto` generated from the OpenAPI spec and populated by a MapStruct mapper. I added the `initials` field in two places:\n\n1. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 added an `initials` read-only string property to the `Owner` schema (alongside the existing `displayName`), so the generated `OwnerDto` gains the field.\n\n2. **`src/main/java/.../mapper/OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 added an `@Mapping` for `initials` backed by a helper that returns the upper-cased first letters of `firstName` and `lastName`, dot-separated with a trailing dot (e.g. `\"john\"`/`\"smith\"` \u2192 `\"J.S.\"`).\n\n`./mvnw test` \u2192 **BUILD SUCCESS**, `AcceptanceTest.coreComputesInitials` passing (`$.initials == \"J.S.\"`).",
